Lookup before mutation: Alice
Lookup AFTER mutation: null
Map contains key? false
Map size (orphaned memory): 1
Slice before modification: [log2, log3]
Caught expected subList invalidation: ConcurrentModificationException
Arrays.asList(int[]) size: 1
Element 0 type: int[]
Correct boxed list: [10, 20, 30] (size: 3)
